== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
{{is mms|setja|put}}
=== Verb ===
'''setjast'''

# to [[sit down|sit (down)]]
#: ''Ég '''sest''' [[niður]].''
#:: I '''sit down'''.
# (of the sun or moon) to [[go down]]
#: ''[[sól|Sólin]] '''sest'''.''
#:: The [[sun]] is '''going down'''.

====Usage notes====
*Often used (in the meaning of "sitting down") with ''[[niður#Icelandic|niður]]'' ("[[down]]").

====Synonyms====
*{{i-c|go down}} [[ganga undir]]

====Antonyms====
*{{i-c|to sit down}} [[standa upp]]

